スト 設定に沿って自由にイラストを描いてください。\n\n・使用可能要素：（以下を含むが限定されない）ユリの花、鍵、魔法書、月桂樹の葉、羽ペン、翼、星など。ご依頼をお受けいただければ幸いです。不適切と感じられた場合は、お断りいただいても構いません。よろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pogpa47985618/works/101", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e402c5f4/uploads/origins/416f6473-df37-41d5-ae19-f5d2ebf1edbc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=176a0818f0764a4826e370f24e18ae6b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e402c5f4/uploads/origins/416f6473-df37-41d5-ae19-f5d2ebf1edbc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=176a0818f0764a4826e370f24e18ae6b, https://si.imgix.net/e402c5f4/uploads/origins/416f6473-df37-41d5-ae19-f5d2ebf1edbc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ada428c5897a18843617834abc6b8c1a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e402c5f4/uploads/origins/416f6473-df37-41d5-ae19-f5d2ebf1edbc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b152618d23aa79ace03da9cdd2f0731a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I saw your post so I'm going to resend my request. Thank you, I am excited to see your illustration!\n\n○Reference: https://sta.sh/0dcepfzwosl\nMirabelle is an ancient pure-blooded vampire from a noble lineage. She runs a detective agency and uses a black parasol to block sunlight. Her personality is a tsundere-like.\n\nPlease draw freely. You can draw her outfit and hair style freely. If you feel that it is inappropriate, it is ok to cancel. Thank you for your time and consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pogpa47985618/works/100", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4bfe61d/uploads/origins/27a28a62-a1b5-4664-9770-32a948a6ffc7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4218e355872d49d61d8aa69c81c5d087", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a4bf